WorkFlow?
Workflow is the sequence of states through which content passes from creation to publication.
In Liferay, workflows are managed using the Kaleo Workflow Engine. It allows organizations to review and approve content before publishing, 
assign review tasks to specific users or roles, track approval actions, and maintain compliance and quality control.
When workflow is enabled, the content usually goes into the Pending state by default after submission. It remains pending until the assigned reviewer reviews and approves or rejects it.

